{"id":"u57","kelas":"kerja","no":10,"judul":"Layanan Pelanggan dan Keluhan","title":"Customer Service and Complaints","emoji":"🎧","ringkas":"Menangani keluhan, meminta maaf, menawarkan solusi","ready":true,"goals":["menyapa pelanggan dan menanyakan kebutuhannya dengan ramah","mendengarkan keluhan dan **berempati**: [[I understand how frustrating that must be.]]","meminta maaf secara profesional: [[I apologise for the inconvenience.]]","menawarkan **solusi** dan menjelaskan langkah selanjutnya","menenangkan pelanggan yang marah dan mengeskalasi masalah dengan sopan","menutup layanan dan melakukan **tindak lanjut**"],"lesson":[{"t":"intro","text":"Pelanggan yang kecewa bisa menjadi pelanggan setia jika keluhannya ditangani dengan baik. Kuncinya ada pada empat langkah: **dengarkan, berempati, beri solusi, dan tindak lanjuti**. Unit ini memberimu bahasa yang tepat untuk setiap langkah."},{"t":"grammar","title":"1. Empat langkah menangani keluhan","table":[["Langkah","Tujuan","Ungkapan"],["**1. Listen**","mendengar masalah sampai selesai","[[Could you tell me what happened?]]"],["**2. Empathise**","menunjukkan pengertian","[[I understand how frustrating that must be.]]"],["**3. Solve**","menawarkan solusi","[[Here's what I can do for you.]]"],["**4. Follow up**","memastikan masalah selesai","[[I'll check with you tomorrow.]]"]]},{"t":"grammar","title":"2. Menyapa dan menanyakan kebutuhan","table":[["Fungsi","Ungkapan"],["Menyapa","[[Good morning. Welcome to ... How can I help you?]]"],["Menawarkan bantuan","[[What can I do for you today?]] / [[How may I assist you?]]"],["Menanyakan masalah","[[Could you tell me more about the problem?]]"],["Meminta data","[[May I have your order number, please?]] / [[Could I have your name?]]"],["Meminta waktu","[[Let me check that for you.]] / [[Could you hold on a moment?]]"]]},{"t":"grammar","title":"3. Empati dan permintaan maaf","table":[["Fungsi","Ungkapan"],["Empati","[[I understand how you feel.]] / [[I can see why you're upset.]]"],["Maaf","[[I'm very sorry about that.]] / [[I apologise for the inconvenience.]]"],["Maaf formal","[[Please accept our sincere apologies.]]"],["Berterima kasih","[[Thank you for bringing this to our attention.]] / [[Thank you for your patience.]]"],["Mengambil tanggung jawab","[[I'll personally make sure this is fixed.]]"]]},{"t":"warn","title":"Hindari menyalahkan pelanggan","text":"Jangan berkata [[That's your fault.]] atau [[You should have read the instructions.]] Gunakan bahasa netral: [[Let me see what went wrong.]] / [[It seems there was a misunderstanding.]]"},{"t":"vocab","title":"4. Kosakata penting","items":[{"en":"complaint","id":"keluhan","ex":"We received a complaint."},{"en":"customer","id":"pelanggan","ex":"The customer is waiting."},{"en":"refund","id":"pengembalian uang","ex":"You will get a full refund."},{"en":"replacement","id":"barang pengganti","ex":"We will send a replacement."},{"en":"exchange","id":"menukar","ex":"Can I exchange this item?"},{"en":"damaged","id":"rusak","ex":"The package arrived damaged."},{"en":"defective","id":"cacat","ex":"The product is defective."},{"en":"delay","id":"keterlambatan","ex":"We apologise for the delay."},{"en":"inconvenience","id":"ketidaknyamanan","ex":"Sorry for the inconvenience."},{"en":"warranty","id":"garansi","ex":"It is still under warranty."},{"en":"receipt","id":"struk / bukti pembelian","ex":"Please show your receipt."},{"en":"escalate","id":"mengeskalasi","ex":"I'll escalate this to my manager."},{"en":"resolve","id":"menyelesaikan","ex":"We will resolve the issue today."},{"en":"compensation","id":"kompensasi","ex":"We offer a discount as compensation."},{"en":"feedback","id":"masukan","ex":"Thank you for your feedback."}]},{"t":"grammar","title":"5. Menawarkan solusi","table":[["Fungsi","Ungkapan"],["Menawarkan","[[I can offer you a refund or a replacement.]]"],["Memberi pilihan","[[Would you prefer a refund or an exchange?]]"],["Menjelaskan langkah","[[First, I'll process your request. Then you'll receive an email within 24 hours.]]"],["Batas waktu","[[It will be delivered within three working days.]]"],["Tidak bisa memenuhi","[[Unfortunately, we are unable to ..., but what I can do is ...]]"],["Mengeskalasi","[[I'll pass this to my supervisor, who will contact you today.]]"]]},{"t":"grammar","title":"6. Menangani pelanggan yang marah","table":[["Situasi","Ungkapan"],["Menenangkan","[[Please let me assure you that we will fix this.]]"],["Tetap tenang","[[I understand. Let's find a solution together.]]"],["Menjelaskan batas","[[I'm afraid that's not possible, but I can ...]]"],["Menutup","[[Is there anything else I can help you with?]] / [[Thank you for calling. Have a good day.]]"]]},{"t":"dialog","title":"Dialog 1: Barang rusak","lines":[{"who":"Dina","en":"Good morning. This is Dina from Customer Service. How can I help you?","id":"Selamat pagi. Saya Dina dari Layanan Pelanggan. Ada yang bisa saya bantu?"},{"who":"Tom","en":"Hello. I ordered a lamp last week, but it arrived damaged.","id":"Halo. Saya memesan lampu minggu lalu, tetapi barangnya tiba dalam keadaan rusak."},{"who":"Dina","en":"I'm very sorry about that, Mr. Wijaya. Could I have your order number, please?","id":"Saya mohon maaf, Pak Wijaya. Boleh saya minta nomor pesanannya?"},{"who":"Tom","en":"It's 4-5-7-2-1.","id":"Nomornya 4-5-7-2-1."},{"who":"Dina","en":"Thank you. I can offer you a full refund or a replacement. Which would you prefer?","id":"Terima kasih. Saya bisa menawarkan pengembalian uang penuh atau barang pengganti. Mana yang Bapak pilih?"},{"who":"Tom","en":"A replacement, please.","id":"Barang pengganti, tolong."},{"who":"Dina","en":"Certainly. It will be delivered within three working days. I apologise for the inconvenience.","id":"Baik. Barangnya akan dikirim dalam tiga hari kerja. Saya minta maaf atas ketidaknyamanannya."}]},{"t":"dialog","title":"Dialog 2: Pelanggan marah","lines":[{"who":"Tom","en":"This is the third time my order is late! This is unacceptable!","id":"Ini ketiga kalinya pesanan saya terlambat! Ini tidak bisa diterima!"},{"who":"Dina","en":"I understand how frustrating that must be, and I sincerely apologise.","id":"Saya mengerti betapa menjengkelkannya itu, dan saya sungguh minta maaf."},{"who":"Dina","en":"Let me check what happened. Could you hold on a moment?","id":"Biar saya periksa apa yang terjadi. Bisakah Bapak menunggu sebentar?"},{"who":"Tom","en":"Okay, but I want it fixed today.","id":"Baik, tapi saya ingin ini diselesaikan hari ini."},{"who":"Dina","en":"I'll pass this to my supervisor, who will contact you before 3 p.m. today. We will also offer you a discount as compensation.","id":"Saya akan meneruskan ini ke atasan saya, yang akan menghubungi Bapak sebelum pukul 3 sore ini. Kami juga akan memberikan diskon sebagai kompensasi."},{"who":"Tom","en":"Thank you. I appreciate that.","id":"Terima kasih. Saya menghargainya."}]},{"t":"tip","title":"Nada suara","text":"Bicara **pelan, tenang, dan jelas**. Jangan menyela pelanggan, ulangi inti masalahnya agar ia merasa didengar ([[So, if I understand correctly, ...]]), dan jangan berjanji sesuatu yang tidak bisa kamu penuhi."},{"t":"summary","items":["Empat langkah: **listen → empathise → solve → follow up**.","Empati dan maaf: [[I understand how you feel.]], [[I apologise for the inconvenience.]]","Solusi: [[I can offer you a refund or a replacement.]]; batas: [[within three working days]].","Jika tidak bisa: [[Unfortunately, ... but what I can do is ...]]; eskalasi: [[I'll pass this to my supervisor.]]","Hindari menyalahkan pelanggan."]}],"practice":[{"type":"match","q":"Pasangkan kosakata dengan artinya:","pairs":[["complaint","keluhan"],["refund","pengembalian uang"],["replacement","barang pengganti"],["damaged","rusak"],["warranty","garansi"]],"exp":"Kosakata layanan pelanggan.","k":"a8d44c5b"},{"type":"match","q":"Pasangkan langkah dengan ungkapannya:","pairs":[["listen","Could you tell me what happened?"],["empathise","I understand how frustrating that is."],["solve","I can offer you a refund."],["follow up","I'll check with you tomorrow."]],"exp":"Empat langkah.","k":"f3dc73d3"},{"type":"match","q":"Pasangkan masalah dengan solusi:","pairs":[["barang rusak","replacement"],["barang tak sesuai","exchange"],["tak puas","refund"],["masalah rumit","escalate"]],"exp":"Solusi.","k":"b27465cd"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Langkah pertama menangani keluhan adalah...","options":["mendengarkan masalah","menyalahkan pelanggan","menutup telepon","menawarkan diskon"],"answer":0,"exp":"Listen first.","k":"6697b2ff"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Ungkapan empati yang tepat adalah...","options":["I understand how frustrating that must be.","That's your problem.","Calm down.","It's not my fault."],"answer":0,"exp":"Empati.","k":"7673e70a"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Ungkapan maaf profesional adalah...","options":["I apologise for the inconvenience.","Whatever.","My bad.","Oops."],"answer":0,"exp":"Formal.","k":"e1598657"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Ungkapan untuk meminta nomor pesanan adalah...","options":["May I have your order number, please?","Give number.","Number you?","Order me."],"answer":0,"exp":"Sopan.","k":"c06994a6"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Cara memberi pilihan solusi adalah...","options":["Would you prefer a refund or an exchange?","Take a refund.","No choice.","Refund exchange."],"answer":0,"exp":"Pilihan.","k":"5431abbe"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Ungkapan untuk meneruskan ke atasan adalah...","options":["I'll pass this to my supervisor.","Ask someone.","Not me.","Go away."],"answer":0,"exp":"Eskalasi.","k":"3a515d93"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Jika tidak bisa memenuhi permintaan, kita berkata...","options":["Unfortunately, we cannot do that, but what I can do is ...","No way.","Impossible.","Stop."],"answer":0,"exp":"Sopan.","k":"1e0fa760"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Mana yang menyalahkan pelanggan (hindari)?","options":["You should have read the instructions.","Let me see what went wrong.","It seems there was a misunderstanding.","I'm sorry for the trouble."],"answer":0,"exp":"Menyalahkan.","k":"6e33b676"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Cara menutup layanan yang baik adalah...","options":["Is there anything else I can help you with?","Done.","That's all, bye.","Stop calling."],"answer":0,"exp":"Menawarkan bantuan tambahan.","k":"d179604a"},{"type":"mcq","q":"\"Within three working days\" artinya...","options":["dalam tiga hari kerja","setelah tiga hari","tiga minggu","sebelum kemarin"],"answer":0,"exp":"within.","k":"bf2c1459"},{"type":"fill","id":"Saya turut menyesal atas hal itu.","q":"I'm very ___ about that.","answers":["sorry"],"hint":"maaf","exp":"sorry.","k":"3a5c630f"},{"type":"fill","id":"Terima kasih atas kesabaran Anda.","q":"Thank you for your ___.","answers":["patience"],"hint":"kesabaran","exp":"patience.","k":"41ea7bf3"},{"type":"fill","id":"Barang itu tiba dalam keadaan rusak.","q":"The package arrived ___.","answers":["damaged"],"hint":"rusak","exp":"damaged.","k":"2e72e147"},{"type":"fill","id":"Kami akan menyelesaikan masalah ini.","q":"We will ___ the issue. (resolve)","answers":["resolve"],"hint":"menyelesaikan","exp":"resolve.","k":"d9a9e988"},{"type":"fill","id":"Saya akan memeriksanya untuk Anda.","q":"Let me ___ that for you.","answers":["check"],"hint":"memeriksa","exp":"check.","k":"edd83e29"},{"type":"fill","id":"Barang akan dikirim dalam tiga hari.","q":"It will be delivered ___ three days.","answers":["within","in"],"hint":"dalam","exp":"within.","k":"517e3fe5"},{"type":"order","q":"Susun kalimat: \"Boleh saya minta nomor pesanan Anda?\"","answer":"May I have your order number, please?","exp":"May I have ...?","k":"d7878120"},{"type":"order","q":"Susun kalimat: \"Saya meminta maaf atas ketidaknyamanan ini.\"","answer":"I apologise for the inconvenience.","exp":"apologise for.","k":"560bcca5"},{"type":"listen","q":"Dengarkan. Apa artinya?","say":"I can offer you a full refund","options":["Saya bisa menawarkan pengembalian uang penuh","Saya meminta uang Anda","Saya menjual barang","Saya lupa uang"],"answer":0,"exp":"refund.","k":"64e159a7"},{"type":"listen","q":"Dengarkan. Apa artinya?","say":"I understand how frustrating that must be","options":["Saya mengerti betapa menjengkelkannya itu","Saya tidak mengerti","Itu menyenangkan","Saya tidak peduli"],"answer":0,"exp":"frustrating.","k":"e87603a0"},{"type":"listen","q":"Dengarkan. Apa artinya?","say":"Thank you for your patience","options":["Terima kasih atas kesabaran Anda","Terima kasih kembali","Saya tidak sabar","Tunggu di luar"],"answer":0,"exp":"patience.","k":"e1e3534c"},{"type":"fill","id":"Selamat datang. Ada yang bisa saya bantu?","q":"Welcome. How may I ___ you?","answers":["assist","help"],"hint":"membantu","exp":"assist.","k":"809b1ea4"},{"type":"fill","id":"Bisakah Anda ceritakan apa yang terjadi?","q":"Could you tell me what ___?","answers":["happened"],"hint":"terjadi","exp":"happened.","k":"50b33f33"},{"type":"fill","id":"Saya bisa melihat mengapa Anda kesal.","q":"I can see ___ you are upset.","answers":["why"],"hint":"mengapa","exp":"why.","k":"1eb84402"},{"type":"fill","id":"Mohon terima permohonan maaf kami.","q":"Please accept our sincere ___.","answers":["apologies"],"hint":"maaf","exp":"apologies.","k":"6176e97f"},{"type":"fill","id":"Saya akan memastikan masalah ini diperbaiki.","q":"I'll personally make ___ this is fixed.","answers":["sure"],"hint":"pasti","exp":"make sure.","k":"dd99475d"},{"type":"fill","id":"Produk itu masih bergaransi.","q":"The product is still under ___.","answers":["warranty"],"hint":"garansi","exp":"warranty.","k":"83dd2b12"},{"type":"fill","id":"Mohon tunjukkan struk Anda.","q":"Please show your ___.","answers":["receipt"],"hint":"struk","exp":"receipt.","k":"0d47a694"},{"type":"fill","id":"Barang pengganti akan dikirim besok.","q":"A ___ will be sent tomorrow.","answers":["replacement"],"hint":"pengganti","exp":"replacement.","k":"40dd4d17"},{"type":"fill","id":"Pengembalian uang akan diproses dalam 24 jam.","q":"The refund will be ___ within 24 hours. (process)","answers":[